  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ffu - WorldFish - Development and Scaling of Sustainable Feeds for Resilient Aquatic Food Systems in Sub-Saharan Africa (FASA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary goal is to develop low-cost, highly nutritious fish feeds based on novel ingredients and enable 5,000 smallholder fish farmers in three African countries, Kenya, Zambia and Nigeria, to test and adopt these ingredients and feeds, leading to increased income, improved food security, and reduced waste and pollution.</narrative>
  </description>
